| Gate | Human action | Stop condition |
|---|---|---|
| Gate 1 | Approve policy title, commencement date, and legal source | If official title/date cannot be verified |
| Gate 2 | Approve source list and access method | If source violates ToS or privacy rules |
| Gate 3 | Review 20-item pilot sample for relevance | If precision is below acceptable threshold |
| Gate 4 | Review 20-item pilot sample for sentiment coding | If labels are inconsistent or biased |
| Gate 5 | Review high-risk flags | If misinformation, PII, or harassment detected |
| Gate 6 | Approve final dataset before analysis | If documentation incomplete |
